Cell["\<\
The idea is that I can make an over factor u1 explicit and then integrate \
over it. 
We just need to u2->u1 u2, u3->u1 u3
REMEMBER TO RESCALE THE MEASURE TOO!!!\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9739179863908024`*^9, 
  3.973918073359476*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c178c746-d464-b341-8a26-\
